<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia to privatise cement factories.</title>
<headline>Tunisia to privatise cement factories.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia plans to privatise five cement factories, the Minister of International Cooperation and Foreign Investment said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We plan to privatise the five cement works...during the coming months. The tenders for some of them are expected to be launched before the end of this year,&quot; Mohamed Ghannouchi told a news conference.</p>
<p>The five cement factories produced about five milion tonnes in 1995. The country exported 1.7 million tonnes of cement last year, worth 70 million dinars.</p>
<p>($=0.97 dinar)</p>
<p>- Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
